  "body": "## Changelog\n* a1cf49a52b36fba66a2bf0907617bd5aadb8a727 Restore --delete to the docs sync (#5293)\n* 6fc232ece9f1d65351f8910f1b56d535a65c9ca9 ci: Remove broken `delete_preflight_apps.sh`. (#5299)\n* e58a4d55bf8c4bc85fc48e625642e2ae7d757adf Add FLY_NO_PROMPT to make flyctl never prompt (#5295)\n* fd57fe46512973007b27a4cce921d7f5b5b5c3c8 Let fly auth login run without a terminal, and finish with --code (#5290)\n\n"
